*> vybe-test: cobol/intrinsics_char/test_intrinsics_char_ord_conversions
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_intrinsics_char.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CHAR PIC X VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-ORD PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(65) TO WS-CHAR.
    DISPLAY WS-CHAR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-CHAR DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "A"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [A] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    COMPUTE WS-ORD = FUNCTION ORD("A").
    DISPLAY WS-ORD.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ORD DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "065"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [065] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

